nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">淘宝MNN团队开源MNN-Pocket-0.3B模型，iPhone 18 Pro离线解码达350 token/s</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面正式发布 Kimi Hosted Agents 托管智能体服务</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta 个人 AI 助手 Muse 上线实时语音对话与虚拟形象功能</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash模型：单次生成时长增至15秒，成本降低30%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4699646d66c40c3e0399ff091b60a196.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布AI视频生成模型Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash，在生成时长、场景一致性及API定价方面实现全面升级。该模型将单次视频生成时长从10秒提升至15秒，720p视频生成成本从每秒0.10美元降至0.07美元，单段15秒720p视频API成本降至1.05美元。技术层面，新模型增强了多视角下的人物、产品及文字保持力，支持多回合对话式编辑，用户无需全局重绘即可调整光线、背景或拍摄角度。此外，模型改进了自然语音处理、唇形同步及多说话人交互能力，并支持最高4K输出。目前，Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash已通过Google AI Studio、Google Cloud、Google Flow及Google Vids面向开发者与创作者开放。此次更新显著降低了视频大模型的商用门槛，推动AI视频生成向</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">用 AI 做 PPT 被开除，公司反赔 4.6 万：法院判了</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c2ed4b47a20ee47c937ab5044d85ce5f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">用 AI 做 PPT 被开除，公司反赔 4.6 万：法院判了AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 6, 202665北京市朝阳区法院近日审结一起劳动争议，把&quot;用 AI 办公&quot;的边界摆上了台面。2024 年 7 月，某保险公司员工吴女士为提效，把自行整理的公司稽核问题数据表上传到第三方 AI 平台，借 AI 辅助做 PPT。耐人寻味的是，此前她的部门与直属领导曾多次推荐这类工具，认为能明显提升效率。可一个月后，公司却以&quot;严重违反信息安全规定&quot;为由将她解雇，吴女士随即把公司告上法庭。法院：没禁止，就别事后算账 公司主张，那张表属内部高度核心保密信息，上传行为有泄露商业秘密的风险。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">淘宝MNN团队开源MNN-Pocket-0.3B模型，iPhone 18 Pro离线解码达350 token/s</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dc8fb6ba207566fadc38f737e394cd79.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">淘宝MNN团队正式开源面向移动端的轻量化大语言模型MNN-Pocket-0.3B。该模型拥有3亿参数，采用INT4量化，部署文件仅173MB。在iPhone 18 Pro真机测试中，其离线解码速度达350 token/s；在iPad Pro M5上，峰值内存增量仅228MB，解码吞吐达466 token/s，性能约为Qwen3-0.6B的1.63倍。为适配中文环境，团队将词表精简至64K。功耗方面，在一加13（骁龙8至尊版）上执行100次任务仅消耗0.3%电量。该模型在IFEval等11项综合评测中表现优异，全面超越MiniCPM4-0.5B等同类模型。此次开源涵盖Base、SFT、端侧部署及投机解码等多个版本，旨在通过MNN推理引擎优化，为开发者提供低内存、低功耗、高吞吐的端侧AI解决方案，推动大模型在手机端</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面正式发布 Kimi Hosted Agents 托管智能体服务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f522f27f968293bce5fa641ed861e48a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">月之暗面（Moonshot AI）于11月5日正式推出 Kimi Hosted Agents 托管智能体服务。该服务将支撑 Agent 高效运行的底层 Harness 框架直接云端化，为企业和开发者提供开箱即用的7×24小时全天候托管运行环境。此举旨在解决传统 AI 应用开发中后端运行环境搭建、调试与维护成本高昂的痛点。通过该服务，开发者无需自行维护复杂架构，即可轻松处理长时间跨度的复杂任务，并为多智能体（Multi-Agent）之间的高效协同提供稳定底座。Kimi Hosted Agents 的上线显著降低了企业落地高级 AI 应用的技术门槛与运维成本，通过云端化运行框架，助力开发者更专注于智能体业务逻辑的构建与优化，推动 AI 应用在复杂场景下的规模化部署。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta 个人 AI 助手 Muse 上线实时语音对话与虚拟形象功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d5b256fb8d19e8a800496f952486380f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta 正式为个人 AI 助手 Muse 推出实时语音对话与虚拟形象功能，现已向美国用户开放，覆盖移动端、网页及 Mac 应用。该功能由 Muse Realtime Voice 与 Muse Realtime Avatar 两个模型协同驱动，前者负责内容生成与语音表达，后者实时同步口型、表情与动作，实现音画高度统一。系统支持流式输出 448×768 分辨率、25fps 的竖屏视频，端到端响应延迟约为 870 毫秒。用户可通过点击应用内电话图标开启对话，支持随时插嘴打断，并提供数百种语音风格及多种虚拟形象选择。该更新旨在满足用户在双手忙碌场景下的交互需求，支持语音任务处理、头脑风暴及面试模拟等功能，同时支持将虚拟形象生成的视频一键分享至 Instagram、Facebook 和 WhatsApp 等社交平台。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
